WEBVTT

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.800
I can't believe George has fallen for Maruga.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.270
Depending on how you look at it, couldn't this be a good thing?

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:20.590
For instance, you could invite George out, and we'd take Ice Rage while he's gone.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.350
We can't do that!

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.490
What will we do if he realizes she's a dragon?

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.860
You've got to take risks if you want to take back your precious sword.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:29.740
Well?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.330
I will do it.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:38.270
I cannot allow you to be the only ones putting yourselves in danger.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.490
It's decided, then.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.680
Let's start planning.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:46.580
Planning? Eriko-san, what are you thinking?

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:24.680
"Unpleasant Awakening"

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:29.350
"It's the prize from yesterday's shooting game."

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.850
"Make sure you give it to Misaki yourself!"

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.460
This thing?

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.270
What are you doing?

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.770
He's here.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.810
Maruga-san!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.570
Thank you for inviting me out today.

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.660
Hello there.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.660
You're cute as always.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.230
I'm Eriko.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:07.100
I've heard about you from Ryuji-kun and Maruga.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.410
Nice to meet you. I'm George.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:16.290
She actually can't swim, but she insisted on seeing you.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:24.110
I'll go get an inner tube!

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.300
He's exactly like you described.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:33.420
I cannot do this. I cannot wear a swimsuit in public...

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.660
What are you saying now?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.490
Don't you want your sword back?

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.330
Hurry up.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.150
Fine.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.230
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.450
That was quick.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.350
You look great.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:08.480
Yeah.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.540
You make a perfect couple.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:14.240
George-san, would you mind if we took off?

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.850
Leave it to me.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:20.740
I, George Evans, will protect Maruga-san with my life!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.630
Let's go!

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:25.210
What? Wait, I am not ready for this!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.290
Do you think they'll be okay?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.090
My plan is perfect.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:37.360
3... 2... 1...

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.920
Where did your swimsuit go?

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:58.780
George-san, could you look for it over there?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.390
Got it!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:05.320
I thought you were going to have him look for a necklace.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.930
You've got to fool your allies to fool your enemies.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.810
My melting swimsuit plan is a huge success.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.400
Where did you get something that?

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:17.410
When I called Tokura-san last night, he said he had researched a Lost Precious like that long ago.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:22.870
Try to keep George occupied as long as you can.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.940
This is just one of the risks. I'm sure you've learned a lot, empress.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:40.410
Now we just need to get Ice Rage out of the church unnoticed...

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:42.840
What's wrong?

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:47.170
You're going to take George's precious sword.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.550
I'll stay here.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.130
What are you...

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.190
That's too bad.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:55.010
We don't have much time. Let's go.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.880
Why does this keep happening to me?

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:02.980
Rose-chan?

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.240
Rose...

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.790
He always tells me not to lie.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.440
He doesn't listen to me.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.930
Does Ryuji hate me?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.060
But we engaged...

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.820
Engaged?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.840
To be married?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.070
Ma-kun!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.400
What's gotten into you?

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.090
Shut up! Hand over the sword!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.950
So much for my perfect plan.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.010
We have to do something about this.

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.420
I know.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:49.380
We'll go once they stop looking at him.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:55.840
That sword on the wall! I'll destroy this world with it!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:56.790
Now!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.240
Genmu, Kocho!

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.830
What is this?

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:13.840
Mommy!

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:13.840
Ma-kun!

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.590
The butterflies! No!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.650
Splendid!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.480
Thank you, thank you!

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:39.610
I don't suppose we could ask them for the sword now.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.400
Don't act so disappointed! You can see, can't you?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:57.290
Shut up! With Ryuji gone and Misaki the way she is this isn't any different from a family vacation!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:04.510
I'm trying to cure your cowardice instead of having a watermelon splitting contest!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.870
Show a little gratitude!

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:08.570
You think you can do that, you gorilla?

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:13.580
Ryuji-kun and Rose-chan are engaged...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.760
They're engaged...

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.770
The culprit's a worshiper of this church.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.290
I know. He was such a quiet, nice man, too.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:32.420
Things have been different since that blond showed up.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.430
George-san.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:46.790
Thank you for protecting the church.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:50.020
You have courage and energy.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:54.620
You're a fine breaker. I've got a lot to learn from you.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:59.840
Maruga-san, I am sorry I could not find your swimsuit.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.110
See you later.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.530
Maruga.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.370
That sword is a Cursed Precious, isn't it?

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:23.450
Cursed Preciouses drag humans into a tainted world.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.930
The source of this curse...

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:33.160
The white dragon killed in the story I told you yesterday was my uncle.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:39.000
Wait a minute. What does this sword have to do with a battle between dragons?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:48.390
As the king and his brother, my father could not allow my uncle's rampage to go unpunished.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:55.070
After much consideration, my father took the form of a human and killed my uncle.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.680
The legendary hero of George-san's story.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.460
Mention of my uncle has become forbidden within my family.

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:10.370
However, I never thought his malice would inhabit the sword.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.250
Why did that happen?

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:32.170
I wish to speak with you about the red dragon.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.440
Are you interested?

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:51.400
Ryuji-kun was once possessed by a Cursed Precious.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.720
I'll do it.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:04.860
I'll try it.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.850
I'll come up with something.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.320
Let's talk to George.

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:13.240
Talking won't do any good.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.530
But George is a good person.

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:18.140
He gave me ice cream, and...

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:20.340
If he knew you were a dragon, he...

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.370
He would understand.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:27.560
There's no way! He assumes dragons are servants of the devil!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.700
You're the one making assumptions!

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.620
I have your best interests in mind!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.620
Liar!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.460
Forget it! You're an idiot!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.590
Rose!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:37.880
My, my.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.540
Excuse me...

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.010
It's fine.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.990
Could you tell me about your uncle?

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.390
My Lord, why are you testing me?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:59.430
Humans are indiscreet and superficial.

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:04.560
White dragons have always been raised to believe this.

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:10.930
My father would scold my uncle for visiting the human world.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:18.030
When I was a young girl, my uncle would give me human sweets and dolls I had never seen before...

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.030
and tell me stories to stop my tears.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.670
He sounds like a nice guy.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:29.590
My family considered him eccentric, but he was very kind to me.

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.220
That sword is a treasure from my uncle's adventures.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.860
It is his only remaining memento.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:42.810
I want to take it back before his wrath loses control and becomes a destructive force.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.620
Could you also be an eccentric dragon for loving your uncle?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.090
It is possible.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:59.410
Where did Rose go?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.130
You don't think she...

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.660
There you are!

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:14.690
We're having a card game tournament all night tonight!

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:18.110
Again? Why do you get to spend all your time with beautiful girls?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.160
Ryuji-kun, your engagement...

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.530
I'm a little busy right now...

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.860
Oh, that's right.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.290
Here.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:26.200
See you later.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.610
Hey!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.530
What was that about?

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.030
The way I see it, his engagement must be a contract.

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.640
Maybe Rose-chan gave Ryuji some kind of weird...

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:01.240
You're a dragon, aren't you?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.430
Let's go.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.510
I still owe you ice cream.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.500
I've been wondering about that for a while, but what is it?

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.330
It is a charm from my father.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.770
Then that's a Lost Precious, too.

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:25.000
I do not know.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:32.100
Are you familiar with confession?

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.200
No.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:38.380
If you confess your sins to God, they will be forgiven.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.620
Sins?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:45.400
Dragons are God's enemy. Their mere existence is sinful.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.630
What's wrong with being a dragon?

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:52.280
You're avatars of the devil bent on the destruction of the human world.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.960
And of all things, you've taken the form of an innocent young girl...

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.570
Have you no shame?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:01.770
I've been like this since the day I was born.

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.560
What have I done?

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.090
What have I done wrong?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.330
Enough!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.500
I must destroy the enemies of God!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.100
George, you're crying.

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.790
I'm not crying!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.850
Then why do you look so sad?

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.220
Silence!

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:24.300
George-san!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.420
Ryuji!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.860
Take a good look at Rose.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.230
She's not a devil.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.720
She's just a girl!

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.700
A girl? She's a dragon!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.830
Give us the sword.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.210
You've been deceived by the Cursed Precious!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:48.250
You've not only sided with a dragon, but now you've insulted my sword!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.190
It is true.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.110
Maruga-san.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:58.200
I am Margarite, the white dragon empress.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.000
You lie.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.970
The man you revere as a hero is my father.

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:07.480
The wrath of my uncle resides in that sword.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.960
I beg your forgiveness for our many trespasses.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.240
Please give us the sword!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.320
I won't be fooled.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.100
I will not be fooled!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:22.750
Ryuji-kun!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.450
On it!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.890
Ryuji, save George.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.260
I know.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:51.900
Maruga!

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:52.930
Are you okay?

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.180
Can't you do that thing you used against Onyx?

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:59.570
That kind of power would destroy a human.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:03.050
Besides, I don't know if I'd even be able to do it again.

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:05.790
It's like George has been taken hostage.

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:08.390
What about this?

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.180
Genmu, Kocho!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:17.900
No way!

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:47.380
It's not over yet!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.340
What are we supposed to do?

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.880
When I let go of the Lost Precious, I...

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.210
Rose, give me your strength.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.170
But...

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.360
Aim for the sword.

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.470
Let's save George together.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.840
Humans and dragons...

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:16.070
I will kill all the living.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.470
Engage.

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:35.070
Engage? A human and a dragon?

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:36.560
Impossible!

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.160
A human and a dragon can never be together!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.840
Do it now! Hurry!

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:48.610
You're trying to kill me?

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.300
Please stop!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.140
Please go back to being my kind uncle!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:02.640
Your uncle is gone.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:06.580
Just like her!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.390
You...

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.210
Get out of the way, Maruga!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:22.320
You and Maruga will only suffer while you're bound by hatred.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.390
Uncle!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:53.720
Um...

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:58.140
It is fine. My uncle has been put to rest.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:02.330
I felt my uncle being released from his hatred...

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:06.750
when he touched the heart of the one he loved in his final moments.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:17.750
I can't believe I was saved by the dragons I have hated for so long.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:21.440
You weren't saved by dragons.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.310
You were saved by Rose and Maruga.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:32.910
I see. They are who they are.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:36.930
I still require much more training.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:45.080
I must be going.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.310
Come visit again some time.

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:48.390
I will.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.650
I am glad I came and met all of you.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.400
Don't stare!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.190
Hey...

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:03.100
You may be engagement partners, but you are not married.

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:11.570
As the white dragon empress, I bless you for the courage you displayed last night.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.100
Take care. I am sure we will meet again.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:26.930
Ryuji-kun.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.930
How did you know I'm a Pon-kun fan?

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:35.230
Thanks. I promise I'll treasure it forever.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.810
Ryuji, let's get married!

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:41.480
Let's get married right now!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:44.800
Is that what you meant by engage?

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.980
We shouldn't have destroyed the church.

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:51.500
It's the last day and we haven't done half the activities!

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:51.720
Why am I stuck with you?

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.890
We'll start with the high speed beach flag competition!

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:54.890
There is no God!

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:39.890
Next episode "Attack of the Wolf"

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.130
I am Maruga the white dragon.

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:31.510
I'm Maruga, not Marta.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:34.040
I told you, I'm Maruga, not Multi.

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.210
I'm Maruga.

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:36.840
Ma-ru...

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:39.260
I bit my tongue...
